# Build context exclusions.
#
# Without this file the entire working tree is sent to the daemon and then
# copied into the build stages — which is slow, and in one case actively
# corrupting: `COPY ai/ ./` carries the host's .venv, a macOS virtualenv whose
# `bin/python` is a symlink to an interpreter that does not exist in the image.
# It lands on top of the Linux venv that `uv sync` just built, and the
# container's Python disappears.
#
# Keep this list in step with what the Dockerfile actually needs.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Version control and CI
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.github

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python — virtualenvs must never cross this boundary
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ai/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
ai/.pytest_cache
ai/.ruff_cache
ai/.mypy_cache

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Node — installed in the web-builder stage from the lockfile instead
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/coverage
web/.vite

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output — rebuilt inside the image
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/nikucooker
/nikucooker.exe
/dist
*.test
coverage.out

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime state — supplied as volumes at run time, never baked in
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/data
/models
/config
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.log
logs

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only design documentation (also gitignored)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/ARCHITECTURE.md
/docs

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
